summary: 'The build plan for the Conductor revival arc: six phases turning the locked thesis (hybrid macOS desktop app = custom conversation UI over Claude Code''s structured headless stream + native control actions + on-call page/reply container) into sequenced work. Phase 0 is the smallest validating spike (one session, stream-json, custom render in-app); each later phase ships an independently useful slice. Synthesized from the two-round team analysis; planning round, not yet implementing.'
