    decision: 'Phase the arc by riskiest-and-most-valuable-first: prove the structured-stream conversation mechanism in-app (Phase 0) before building the fleet spine, the on-call paging, or the hybrid web integration.'
    rationale: Jinx's smallest-validating-step discipline + the stream mechanism is the keystone the whole arc rests on; validate it on the real Swift target before investing in surface.
