    decision: Each phase ships an independently useful slice (single-session conv UI → fleet spine → page-back → hybrid panes → learning loop). No big-bang.
    rationale: Honors web-primary, avoids re-fragmentation, lets the founder feel friction-relief early (the conversation UI + spine kill the terminal-sprawl pain in Phases 1-2).
